Orange Laser was added in '''Beta 6.6'''. Its first change happened in '''Beta 12.1''', where its ATK was buffed from 0 to 1. As a result, it will not die instantly from [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Madjick Madjick]. [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Blue_Laser Blue Laser] got the same change.
=== Stats ===
ATK:
* 0 (Post Beta 6.6)
* 1 (Post Beta 12.1, Current)
HP: 8

Cost: 4

Ability: Start of turn: Deal 3 DMG to all enemy monsters that didn't attack last turn (except those played last turn).

Rarity: White (Common)

== Trivia ==
* Its description was updated to clearify it cound't affect monsters that were just played.
